  unitName: Dark Seraph Ardin
  unitId: 60594
  unitNumber: 731
  description: A vagrant with jet black wings. Wandering about aimlessly, he learned
    how to fence and use magic through his own self-taught training. He used his
    powers to save people in all regions, gaining more companions by the minute as
    he moved along. Most of his new allies are said to have been people who, like
    him, had been ostracized from society. When the invasion of the gods began, he
    set out to destroy the Fallen God Lagzal, but the god annihilated all of his
    comrades, leaving Ardin to grieve for them alone.
  summonDesc: Who dares summon me?!<br>Hahaha, just kidding.<br>I'll help you out!
  fusionDesc: If you're looking for compensation,<br>you might as well quit now.<br>I
    make promises to no one.
  evoDesc: What a familiar feeling...<br>Is it a memory from my time with them?<br>Nah,
    I'm overthinking things.
